                                "sense_id": "e4831c9d-a328-3c34-93b0-affb1605b9c3",
                                "text": "Once it was determined that hyperthyroidism was the probable etiology of her cardiac decompensation, the next step was treatment of the underlying disease."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9bcf67e4-5c15-3e9c-a6f7-f507ded06fcf",
